{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;One step from death. One shot from victory.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&lt;Project Revenant&gt;</i> is a remake and successor to &lt;<i>Revenant&gt;</i>.<br>a game where a single hit can end everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/84ba39cadcc5fb00e00e797e003a2553.poster.avif?t=1758574605\" width=1146 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/84ba39cadcc5fb00e00e797e003a2553.webm?t=1758574605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/84ba39cadcc5fb00e00e797e003a2553.mp4?t=1758574605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you must master the unique combat system known as <strong>\u201cPrecision Aiming\u201d</strong>, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >where only enemies directly under your cursor will take damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a game where you can spray bullets and hope for the best.<br>You\u2019ll need to carefully analyze each enemy\u2019s position and attack pattern, then strike with accuracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headshot an enemy to take them out instantly, shoot down a chandelier to crush enemies beneath it,<br>or ignite an explosive barrel to wipe out a group of foes. Every encounter is a tactical decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Gimmicks</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/302523761dcab76da2941de7923ba02a.poster.avif?t=1758574605\" width=748 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/302523761dcab76da2941de7923ba02a.webm?t=1758574605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/302523761dcab76da2941de7923ba02a.mp4?t=1758574605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage introduces new gimmicks\u2014use them creatively to defeat waves of enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinct Boss Fights</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/388ccb05a6c6f58843d93ab41758b7bc.poster.avif?t=1758574605\" width=914 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/388ccb05a6c6f58843d93ab41758b7bc.webm?t=1758574605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/388ccb05a6c6f58843d93ab41758b7bc.mp4?t=1758574605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/706eba188d6534ad87e9a3af070f3942.poster.avif?t=1758574605\" width=416 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/706eba188d6534ad87e9a3af070f3942.webm?t=1758574605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/706eba188d6534ad87e9a3af070f3942.mp4?t=1758574605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyborg ninjas, giant robots, bounty hunters...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against RPG-style bosses with memorable designs and mechanics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Skills</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/c1d966ea08f9a082bb814aa86184b717.poster.avif?t=1758574605\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/c1d966ea08f9a082bb814aa86184b717.webm?t=1758574605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/c1d966ea08f9a082bb814aa86184b717.mp4?t=1758574605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip skills that match your playstyle and shape your own combat strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Environments</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/700f9d6acbb74cbd638d85bb8e11069e.poster.avif?t=1758574605\" width=716 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/700f9d6acbb74cbd638d85bb8e11069e.webm?t=1758574605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850590/extras/700f9d6acbb74cbd638d85bb8e11069e.mp4?t=1758574605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From sewers and underground clubs to towering skyscrapers\u2014team up with &quot;Beta&quot; and complete your mission.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li>